# swarm-chase.vrs: swarm D15 probe (Session 2). Session 1's sw-arena units never left the spawn spot: Chaos moved by
# teleport, so nothing chased and the arena return was never needed. Here Chaos WALKS out of the arena (held keys), so
# the spiders that engaged Chaos follow it and either the game's leash turns them back or a
# "[nyar] arena sw-arena: returned <n>, farthest <d> m" line follows. Each stop logs Chaos's position ([DEV WHERE]) and
# the units' positions (`.nyar debug here`), read from the log afterwards. Neither outcome fails the scenario; the
# checks are the spawn, the 8 tracked units at the end, the combat at 10 m and the clean stop.
#
# Needs: NyarDevTools, DevChatEcho; Chaos invulnerable (`ToggleInvulnerable true`, a Boolean, never false); the
# sw-arena entry of swarm.vrs in the dev events.json.
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 4
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .nyar event reload
expect-log events: reloaded
chat .nyar event set sw-arena location here
expect-reply sw-arena
mark
chat .nyar event start sw-arena
expect-log event sw-arena started by
expect-log event sw-arena wave 1/1: 8 units queued timeout=30
wait 10
chat .nyar debug here 10
expect-reply CHAR_Spider_Forest sw-arena
shot full chase-spawn
# walk east in three legs; after each, Chaos's position and every tracked unit within 70 m
hold d 2
wait 2
chat .devwhere
expect-log \[DEV WHERE\]
chat .nyar debug here 70
shot full chase-leg1
hold d 3
wait 2
chat .devwhere
expect-log \[DEV WHERE\]
chat .nyar debug here 70
shot full chase-leg2
hold d 4
wait 2
chat .devwhere
expect-log \[DEV WHERE\]
chat .nyar debug here 70
shot full chase-leg3
# stay out 30 s: two arena checks at least; then where everything is
wait 30
chat .devwhere
expect-log \[DEV WHERE\]
chat .nyar debug here 80
shot full chase-out30
# back to 10 m from the spot: are the units there and fighting
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 1
chat .nyar debug here 35
expect-reply CHAR_Spider_Forest sw-arena
chat .nyar status
expect-reply tracked units: 8
hold d 1
wait 4
shot full chase-near
wait 6
shot full chase-near-10s
chat .nyar event stop sw-arena
expect-log event sw-arena stopped
expect-log event sw-arena scoreboard:
expect-no-log arena sw-arena: timeout=15
chat .nyar status
expect-reply tracked units: 0
